  "acrm---key-feature-6-content": "<h3>Code you can take with you</h3><p>Put the form on a custom domain, built in and paid for with credits, or embed it on a site you already run. On paid plans, export the full code to GitHub and keep building there.</p>",
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Registration Form Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a registration form?\", \"a\": \"A registration form collects what an organizer needs to add someone to a list, whether that list is an event, a program, a membership, or a product warranty. It starts with a name and contact details. The rest depends on the list, such as a ticket type or a serial number.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create a registration form?\", \"a\": \"Start with the list you want at the end, then work back to the questions. Describe the registration to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a> in plain English: who signs up, what they choose, any fee, and any cap. Emergent builds the form and a table that holds every registration.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should an event registration form include?\", \"a\": \"Begin with the guest's name and email, then the ticket or session they want. Add only what changes the day itself, like meal choice or accessibility needs. For multi-day programs with tracks and speakers, a conference registration form handles session picks and badges.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is there a free registration form template?\", \"a\": \"Plenty of form builders offer one. A registration form template saves typing, but it rarely knows your caps or deadlines. Pick one when your list has no special rules. Otherwise, describing your own takes less time than reworking a free registration form until it fits.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can I make an online registration form for free?\", \"a\": \"Yes. Emergent is free to start, and the free tier covers building and publishing. A free online registration form built this way has no cap on how many people register. Each registration is saved as a row you can export at any time.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I make a registration form in HTML?\", \"a\": \"Wrap labeled input fields in a form element and end it with a submit button. Giving the email field type='email' makes the browser check that the address is well formed before the form submits. Emergent writes this markup along with the database behind it, and you can export the code.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a customer registration form?\", \"a\": \"A customer registration form signs up a new customer and saves their contact details, account choices, and consent to hear from you as one customer record. Product registration is one kind. The buyer adds a serial number and purchase date, often with a photo of the receipt, and any later warranty claim is checked against that record.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I see a sample registration form?\", \"a\": \"Each use case on this page is a sample registration form you can start from. Open the prompt behind one and change the details to match your list. A creator application shows the same build for screening applicants instead of registering them.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do registration forms for events take payment?\", \"a\": \"Through a payment processor such as Stripe. The registrant pays on a Stripe-hosted checkout page, and the registration is confirmed once Stripe reports the payment complete. Taking the fee in the same flow as an online event registration form means nobody holds a seat without paying.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can an online event registration form close itself when the event is full?\", \"a\": \"Yes. Set a capacity when you describe the form. The app counts confirmed registrations against it, closes the form once the last seat is taken, and offers a waitlist to anyone who arrives after that. Raising the cap later reopens the form without rebuilding it.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
}